(5095666, 743347, 97166, '<td valign="top">They thought it was just the sun, as usual, shining through the clouds, like it had a billion times before.  However, rarely had it shone so bright, or so briefly.  It burst in one moment, shone for a short time, and then faded as quickly as it had come. <br/> <br/>Not much more was thought of it then, and life continued as it always had.<br/> <br/>Until they came, and the sun never shone on humanity again.</td>', 'They thought it was just the sun, as usual, shining through the clouds, like it had a billion times before.  However, rarely had it shone so bright, or so briefly.  It burst in one moment, shone for a short time, and then faded as quickly as it had come.  Not much more was thought of it then, and life continued as it always had. Until they came, and the sun never shone on humanity again.', '2008-12-01 19:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
