(5095682, 743662, 97166, '<td valign="top">It didn''t take Old Man Burrows long to realize that he''d made the wrong career choice.  "Be a Siren!" the ads said, "Live a life of song and adventure!" they said. "Bring wanderers to their doom and gorge on the meat of humanity!" They promised.<br/> <br/>Old Man Burrows watched as one of his fellow workers prepared herself for another night of seduction and feasting and grumped.  Few people ever came when HE sang, and of those that did, they all ran screaming away from him. <br/> <br/>Yes, he''d definitely made the wrong choice.  Sighing, he picked up the remains of a squirrel he''d managed to catch and gnawed on it.  He was so stupid.</td>', 'It didn''t take Old Man Burrows long to realize that he''d made the wrong career choice.  "Be a Siren!" the ads said, "Live a life of song and adventure!" they said. "Bring wanderers to their doom and gorge on the meat of humanity!" They promised. Old Man Burrows watched as one of his fellow workers prepared herself for another night of seduction and feasting and grumped.  Few people ever came when HE sang, and of those that did, they all ran screaming away from him.  Yes, he''d definitely made the wrong choice.  Sighing, he picked up the remains of a squirrel he''d managed to catch and gnawed on it.  He was so stupid.', '2008-12-01 20:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
