(5097066, 742733, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely nightscape - i can see why you wanted the bridge on the left in the scene but it seems unbalanced with it there - but i wonder if a tighter crop to just on the outside of the left most post would have been in order</td>', 'lovely nightscape - i can see why you wanted the bridge on the left in the scene but it seems unbalanced with it there - but i wonder if a tighter crop to just on the outside of the left most post would have been in order', '2008-12-02 07:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5097067, 739099, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent details</td>', 'excellent details', '2008-12-02 07:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5097069, 743114, 67152, '<td valign="top">the rise of the road almost gives this an unbalanced feel - I wonder if a higher perspective to show more of the road would have really given this one a lift (and I realize it may not have been possible to do).  also, the sky could really have used a few more of those puffy clouds to give it some more interest</td>', 'the rise of the road almost gives this an unbalanced feel - I wonder if a higher perspective to show more of the road would have really given this one a lift (and I realize it may not have been possible to do).  also, the sky could really have used a few more of those puffy clouds to give it some more interest', '2008-12-02 07:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5097077, 740207, 67152, '<td valign="top">the composition is outstanding and the light and glow are really charming - but there is something about it that does not quite work out as well as it could be - a bit of motion during the exposure to reduce the tack sharpness of the mill and stationary part? - the overt greens in the water to give an unnatural feel? - something that i can''t quite put my finger on</td>', 'the composition is outstanding and the light and glow are really charming - but there is something about it that does not quite work out as well as it could be - a bit of motion during the exposure to reduce the tack sharpness of the mill and stationary part? - the overt greens in the water to give an unnatural feel? - something that i can''t quite put my finger on', '2008-12-02 07:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5097081, 742400, 67152, '<td valign="top">extremely dramatic vista - the lines and angles really make the shot - the colors seem a bit too saturated for my taste but I am sure other DPC voters will love it so it is a good choice here</td>', 'extremely dramatic vista - the lines and angles really make the shot - the colors seem a bit too saturated for my taste but I am sure other DPC voters will love it so it is a good choice here', '2008-12-02 07:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
