(5099013, 743190, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like individual aspects of this scene - the texture in the foreground and the lighting in the background. Having said that, there''s something about the composition that is off for me. I can''t quite identify what that is. The rock face seems to be taking up too much of the frame.</td>', 'I like individual aspects of this scene - the texture in the foreground and the lighting in the background. Having said that, there''s something about the composition that is off for me. I can''t quite identify what that is. The rock face seems to be taking up too much of the frame.', '2008-12-02 19:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5099017, 743233, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very neat image. I like the abstract feel to it. 7</td>', 'Very neat image. I like the abstract feel to it. 7', '2008-12-02 19:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
