(5099084, 743294, 98647, '<td valign="top">Good textures, but you have two photos here. You could crop the top half of the sky off and have a stronger photo, or you could crop some of the sand off and have a stronger photo.</td>', 'Good textures, but you have two photos here. You could crop the top half of the sky off and have a stronger photo, or you could crop some of the sand off and have a stronger photo.', '2008-12-02 19:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
