(5103336, 742842, 89341, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to be constructive but it''s hard. I''m not American and don''t live in America and am bored of have the American election thrust down my throat from all media, I was glad it was finally over! Anyway, I''ll stop ranting! It''s got a good sense of atmosphere with the people in front, colours are vibrant and the focus is good but there is little "wow" factor to the photo, maybe if you are American then there would be more.</td>', 'I''m trying to be constructive but it''s hard. I''m not American and don''t live in America and am bored of have the American election thrust down my throat from all media, I was glad it was finally over! Anyway, I''ll stop ranting! It''s got a good sense of atmosphere with the people in front, colours are vibrant and the focus is good but there is little "wow" factor to the photo, maybe if you are American then there would be more.', '2008-12-03 19:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
