(5103343, 743676, 89341, '<td valign="top">It does look quite cool but seems over photoshopped to me, maybe that was the colour of the stream .... still quite a nice image though</td>', 'It does look quite cool but seems over photoshopped to me, maybe that was the colour of the stream .... still quite a nice image though', '2008-12-03 19:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103348, 743400, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  I like the shapes and colors; might crop tighter on top and bring the hearts up from their vertical centered position.</td>', 'Nice angle.  I like the shapes and colors; might crop tighter on top and bring the hearts up from their vertical centered position.', '2008-12-03 19:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103350, 738960, 89341, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting but there are a few distractions imho. I think to show a view it would be better without the corner of the red shed or whatever it is blocking a third of the photo. I also want to see more on the left to see what the dog is looking at and a larger dof wouldn''t hurt either. That said, the focus on the dog is good.</td>', 'I like the lighting but there are a few distractions imho. I think to show a view it would be better without the corner of the red shed or whatever it is blocking a third of the photo. I also want to see more on the left to see what the dog is looking at and a larger dof wouldn''t hurt either. That said, the focus on the dog is good.', '2008-12-03 19:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103353, 743764, 89341, '<td valign="top">ha ha, that''s quite funny.</td>', 'ha ha, that''s quite funny.', '2008-12-03 19:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103354, 742470, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  I hope you tossed them a crumb or two to thank them for posing so nicely.</td>', 'I like the composition.  I hope you tossed them a crumb or two to thank them for posing so nicely.', '2008-12-03 19:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103356, 743325, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression and fantastic detail in the fur. Nice shallow dof really isolates him/her as well.</td>', 'Great facial expression and fantastic detail in the fur. Nice shallow dof really isolates him/her as well.', '2008-12-03 19:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103357, 743418, 65234, '<td valign="top">Who''s guarding whom?  Sweet moment.</td>', 'Who''s guarding whom?  Sweet moment.', '2008-12-03 19:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103359, 743668, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern created from all the benches.</td>', 'Nice pattern created from all the benches.', '2008-12-03 19:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103362, 738532, 89341, '<td valign="top">Yikes! I hope they are just fighting over that and aren''t actually hooked together! Great stopped motion with just a little movement in the wings to still give some motion to the shot</td>', 'Yikes! I hope they are just fighting over that and aren''t actually hooked together! Great stopped motion with just a little movement in the wings to still give some motion to the shot', '2008-12-03 19:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103363, 743428, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great textures and details in this obviously from the lady but also the leaves, the wall, the shadows on the wall</td>', 'Great textures and details in this obviously from the lady but also the leaves, the wall, the shadows on the wall', '2008-12-03 19:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103368, 743649, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Selective desat is perfect for this.<br/> <br/>Bet this little girl grows up to be eminently self-confident; she''s got a good start if her mom is supporting her choices already ;-)</td>', 'LOL!  Selective desat is perfect for this. Bet this little girl grows up to be eminently self-confident; she''s got a good start if her mom is supporting her choices already ;-)', '2008-12-03 19:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103372, 743454, 89341, '<td valign="top">Slightly weird and slightly worrying on what looks like an active train line ... I can''t quite get past how dangerous and stupid this looks, if there was grass coming through the rails showing it was disused, but then the meaning of your shot would be gone. I''ve not know anyone personally but over the years there have been too many people killed on local train tracks for this image to install anything but horror in me.</td>', 'Slightly weird and slightly worrying on what looks like an active train line ... I can''t quite get past how dangerous and stupid this looks, if there was grass coming through the rails showing it was disused, but then the meaning of your shot would be gone. I''ve not know anyone personally but over the years there have been too many people killed on local train tracks for this image to install anything but horror in me.', '2008-12-03 19:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103376, 739807, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well seen, nice tones.</td>', 'Well seen, nice tones.', '2008-12-03 20:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103377, 739597, 65234, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Great stop-action.  I see there''s a third cat who decided to stay out of the mix this time ;-)</td>', 'Whoa!  Great stop-action.  I see there''s a third cat who decided to stay out of the mix this time ;-)', '2008-12-03 20:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103378, 741451, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great stopped action, you really get a sense of power from the waves ... I do wish the surfer was better it and maybe just a little larger in the frame, still a great capture though</td>', 'Great stopped action, you really get a sense of power from the waves ... I do wish the surfer was better it and maybe just a little larger in the frame, still a great capture though', '2008-12-03 20:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103379, 743049, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just odd enough to be fascinating.</td>', 'Just odd enough to be fascinating.', '2008-12-03 20:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103382, 743311, 89341, '<td valign="top">Interesting and different</td>', 'Interesting and different', '2008-12-03 20:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103384, 743346, 89341, '<td valign="top">Filled the frame well with this little fella</td>', 'Filled the frame well with this little fella', '2008-12-03 20:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103385, 742531, 65234, '<td valign="top">Picture perfect portrait.</td>', 'Picture perfect portrait.', '2008-12-03 20:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103386, 741851, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the rose and leaves but also having a nice shallow dof behind as well.</td>', 'Nice focus on the rose and leaves but also having a nice shallow dof behind as well.', '2008-12-03 20:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103387, 743586, 89341, '<td valign="top">Lovely misty sea, I like the rocks poking through. Clouds are nice in this as well.</td>', 'Lovely misty sea, I like the rocks poking through. Clouds are nice in this as well.', '2008-12-03 20:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103388, 743025, 65234, '<td valign="top">Which reminds me; I need to fill the bird feeders in the morning ;-)  I love the one upside-down goldfinch with everyone else pretty upright.  Just had to be different, huh?</td>', 'Which reminds me; I need to fill the bird feeders in the morning ;-)  I love the one upside-down goldfinch with everyone else pretty upright.  Just had to be different, huh?', '2008-12-03 20:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103391, 743546, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Like he''s peeking around the corner ;-)</td>', 'Great shot!  Like he''s peeking around the corner ;-)', '2008-12-03 20:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103393, 743440, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the wideangle here. This entry seems very Melethish. (Is that a word? It is now.) If this is not a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> entry, it is a very similar style.</td>', 'I like the use of the wideangle here. This entry seems very Melethish. (Is that a word? It is now.) If this is not a  Melethia entry, it is a very similar style.', '2008-12-03 20:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103396, 743775, 65234, '<td valign="top">Eww.  I know; I always say that about spiders.  This is particularly gross since he''s in mid-meal.  well shot and all, but ... eww.</td>', 'Eww.  I know; I always say that about spiders.  This is particularly gross since he''s in mid-meal.  well shot and all, but ... eww.', '2008-12-03 20:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103397, 743338, 89341, '<td valign="top">I like the mistyness but I find the colours a little dark and flat. In photoshop shadow/highlights @ 20% and 8% increase in saturation and auto levels really make this image pop in a matter of seconds.</td>', 'I like the mistyness but I find the colours a little dark and flat. In photoshop shadow/highlights @ 20% and 8% increase in saturation and auto levels really make this image pop in a matter of seconds.', '2008-12-03 20:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103398, 737893, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks familiar. A brighter sky would have helped.</td>', 'Looks familiar. A brighter sky would have helped.', '2008-12-03 20:06:39.000000', NULL, 1);
