(5103448, 738215, 48697, '<td valign="top">Has a nice painterly feel to this, I could see it on the front of a fairy tale book.</td>', 'Has a nice painterly feel to this, I could see it on the front of a fairy tale book.', '2008-12-03 20:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
