(5103593, 743735, 65234, '<td valign="top">See, this is one of those songs I forgot I knew, but as soon as I read the title I started hearing it in my head!  Nice DOF on the shot; I''ll have to see if the song is here for a brief visit or is viral before I decide if I like the title ;-)</td>', 'See, this is one of those songs I forgot I knew, but as soon as I read the title I started hearing it in my head!  Nice DOF on the shot; I''ll have to see if the song is here for a brief visit or is viral before I decide if I like the title ;-)', '2008-12-03 20:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5103604, 742400, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite intriguing.  The blues in the sea are intense.<br/> <br/><i>eta:  fixed a silly typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-08 06:44:36.</i></td>', 'Quite intriguing.  The blues in the sea are intense. eta:  fixed a silly typo', '2008-12-03 20:48:25.000000', '2008-12-08 06:44:36.000000', 1),
