(5104683, 738719, 27161, '<td valign="top">The left side of his shirt is blown out.  Aside from that the photo looks too perfectly lit if that makes sense, as if it were in a studio. 6</td>', 'The left side of his shirt is blown out.  Aside from that the photo looks too perfectly lit if that makes sense, as if it were in a studio. 6', '2008-12-04 07:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5104684, 743301, 89341, '<td valign="top">Makes quite a cool abstract</td>', 'Makes quite a cool abstract', '2008-12-04 07:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5104696, 743694, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait</td>', 'Nice portrait', '2008-12-04 08:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5104699, 742675, 89341, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, you''ve kind of lost my interest already in the title, personally I really don''t like such deliberate poor spelling but this is a photography challenge so I will try and ignore that. The concrete post is quite distracting, the fact that they are looking at you removes most of the candidness of this shot. To be honest I am far more interested in the couple inside the coffee shop / restaurant, there seems to be a more interesting story behind that. And aside from the reflection the girl on the right could be interesting if she wasn''t cropped.</td>', 'Hmmm, you''ve kind of lost my interest already in the title, personally I really don''t like such deliberate poor spelling but this is a photography challenge so I will try and ignore that. The concrete post is quite distracting, the fact that they are looking at you removes most of the candidness of this shot. To be honest I am far more interested in the couple inside the coffee shop / restaurant, there seems to be a more interesting story behind that. And aside from the reflection the girl on the right could be interesting if she wasn''t cropped.', '2008-12-04 08:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5104704, 742323, 89341, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, the reflection is nice but I''m not so much a fan of the sepia(ish) toning</td>', 'Interesting view, the reflection is nice but I''m not so much a fan of the sepia(ish) toning', '2008-12-04 08:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5104705, 743687, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great pov, great focus on her face. Nice colours as well from the fallen leaves in the background.</td>', 'Great pov, great focus on her face. Nice colours as well from the fallen leaves in the background.', '2008-12-04 08:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5104708, 742959, 89341, '<td valign="top">wow, you''ve either got a great hide or a great zoom lens! Very nice capture, I like the stag further back, really adds something extra to this.</td>', 'wow, you''ve either got a great hide or a great zoom lens! Very nice capture, I like the stag further back, really adds something extra to this.', '2008-12-04 08:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5104714, 743042, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great colours in this but I find I am searching round the image for something in focus. At f/1.4 amd 1/13s exposure you are really going to struggle for focus as the dof will be pretty small. If you didn''t use one a tripod would be useful or upping the ISO higher than 800 would allow a faster shutter / smaller aperture.</td>', 'Great colours in this but I find I am searching round the image for something in focus. At f/1.4 amd 1/13s exposure you are really going to struggle for focus as the dof will be pretty small. If you didn''t use one a tripod would be useful or upping the ISO higher than 800 would allow a faster shutter / smaller aperture.', '2008-12-04 08:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5104715, 742712, 89341, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, great lighting, great pose, great focus, great composition ... great!</td>', 'Lovely portrait, great lighting, great pose, great focus, great composition ... great!', '2008-12-04 08:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5104720, 738719, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, good dof to isolate the guy. My only slight cc would be to try and desat the greens/yellows just a very small amount to isolate him even more</td>', 'Nice portrait, good dof to isolate the guy. My only slight cc would be to try and desat the greens/yellows just a very small amount to isolate him even more', '2008-12-04 08:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
