(5104755, 743372, 89341, '<td valign="top">No offence but I think I prefer the original one having googled it. The cropped leaves at the top left are a little bit of a distraction and I think the twig through the middle would be better if it was in focus</td>', 'No offence but I think I prefer the original one having googled it. The cropped leaves at the top left are a little bit of a distraction and I think the twig through the middle would be better if it was in focus', '2008-12-04 08:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
