(5104799, 742078, 89341, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, the colours of her outfit really help lift her out of the shot from the dreary doors. I almost like the lighting, just a touch more light in her face ... or maybe just her hair out of her eyes</td>', 'Interesting composition, the colours of her outfit really help lift her out of the shot from the dreary doors. I almost like the lighting, just a touch more light in her face ... or maybe just her hair out of her eyes', '2008-12-04 08:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
