(5106573, 741420, 76335, '<td valign="top">Compositionally you have the right idea. The technicals need some work. It''s overexposed and there''s motion blur. Try shooting at dawn or dusk or on an overcast day, and maybe cut out the sky to increase the sense of abstraction. And use a tripod. It might work better in black and white. (Check out my only ribbon for a similar architecture shot.)</td>', 'Compositionally you have the right idea. The technicals need some work. It''s overexposed and there''s motion blur. Try shooting at dawn or dusk or on an overcast day, and maybe cut out the sky to increase the sense of abstraction. And use a tripod. It might work better in black and white. (Check out my only ribbon for a similar architecture shot.)', '2008-12-04 18:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
