(5106582, 736862, 89341, '<td valign="top">great colours and nice lights in the distance. However, you have some serious sensor dust, you could have cloned them out. You can get sensor cleaning swabs which work very well and are pretty cheap. Your horizon needs to be levelled out as well. With a 2 mins work in a photo editing program I''d have given this a 7</td>', 'great colours and nice lights in the distance. However, you have some serious sensor dust, you could have cloned them out. You can get sensor cleaning swabs which work very well and are pretty cheap. Your horizon needs to be levelled out as well. With a 2 mins work in a photo editing program I''d have given this a 7', '2008-12-04 18:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
