(5107253, 743767, 97166, '<td valign="top">When they unearthed them so many millenia later, a shocking discovery was made.  It seemed that a monster of legend, the Gorgon, was not confined to the ancient Greek era after all, and had, at least once, showed up in 1930s America as well.</td>', 'When they unearthed them so many millenia later, a shocking discovery was made.  It seemed that a monster of legend, the Gorgon, was not confined to the ancient Greek era after all, and had, at least once, showed up in 1930s America as well.', '2008-12-04 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
