(5108531, 743418, 98141, '<td valign="top">What a cute pair! I like the colors in this one, really showcases the texture of the fur. Lighting and DOF are good too.</td>', 'What a cute pair! I like the colors in this one, really showcases the texture of the fur. Lighting and DOF are good too.', '2008-12-05 09:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
