(5108533, 740736, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great colors and interesting subject. Also, nice composition. I like this.</td>', 'Great colors and interesting subject. Also, nice composition. I like this.', '2008-12-05 09:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108534, 743663, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, love the colors and lighting too, great capture.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, love the colors and lighting too, great capture.', '2008-12-05 09:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108535, 742777, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of this, I wish the light reflected off the glasses wasn''t so bright, it''s distracting a bit.</td>', 'I like the darkness of this, I wish the light reflected off the glasses wasn''t so bright, it''s distracting a bit.', '2008-12-05 09:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108536, 743694, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice use of b&amp;w, I like the lighting here.</td>', 'Nice use of b&w, I like the lighting here.', '2008-12-05 09:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108537, 743025, 98141, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this feels so frenzied and fast-paced, nice capture. I love the snow in the pic.</td>', 'Whoa, this feels so frenzied and fast-paced, nice capture. I love the snow in the pic.', '2008-12-05 09:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108538, 743699, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a version in color. The rays of sun look great in the back. Nice composition.</td>', 'I''d like to see a version in color. The rays of sun look great in the back. Nice composition.', '2008-12-05 09:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108539, 742854, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very romantic feeling, the lighting is beautiful. Makes me want to go riding!</td>', 'Very romantic feeling, the lighting is beautiful. Makes me want to go riding!', '2008-12-05 09:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108540, 740769, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the color choice, it works well in this pic. I don''t like the dark band at the bottom of the pic.</td>', 'I like the color choice, it works well in this pic. I don''t like the dark band at the bottom of the pic.', '2008-12-05 09:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108541, 741203, 98141, '<td valign="top">So handsome :) I''d like if the colors were a little more saturated.</td>', 'So handsome :) I''d like if the colors were a little more saturated.', '2008-12-05 09:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108546, 742979, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very soft and a beautiful model, but I think her hair doesn''t work well with the rest of the pic, it seems like she just went swimming, I wish it were fuller.</td>', 'Very soft and a beautiful model, but I think her hair doesn''t work well with the rest of the pic, it seems like she just went swimming, I wish it were fuller.', '2008-12-05 09:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108547, 740917, 98141, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh, but it''s a cool effect having it come from the book like that.</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh, but it''s a cool effect having it come from the book like that.', '2008-12-05 09:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108548, 742078, 98141, '<td valign="top">I keep alternating between liking this pic and disliking it. I think that a little backlighting on her hair would have made it feel more well-rounded. I do very much like the colors.</td>', 'I keep alternating between liking this pic and disliking it. I think that a little backlighting on her hair would have made it feel more well-rounded. I do very much like the colors.', '2008-12-05 09:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108549, 743540, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast needs to be higher or something, maybe less exposure, everything seems to blend together a little too much for me.</td>', 'I think the contrast needs to be higher or something, maybe less exposure, everything seems to blend together a little too much for me.', '2008-12-05 09:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108550, 742602, 98141, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful, nothing to pick at here, everything works together and in such a great way.</td>', 'Simply beautiful, nothing to pick at here, everything works together and in such a great way.', '2008-12-05 09:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108551, 743692, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the road curving around. Something feels like it''s missing, but I can''t put my finger on it. Overall, I like it for its simplicity.</td>', 'I like the composition with the road curving around. Something feels like it''s missing, but I can''t put my finger on it. Overall, I like it for its simplicity.', '2008-12-05 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108552, 743344, 98141, '<td valign="top">Classic, beautiful. Nice texture with the water and the lighting is nice as well.</td>', 'Classic, beautiful. Nice texture with the water and the lighting is nice as well.', '2008-12-05 09:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108553, 742444, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think that trimming a portion off the right bit of the frame would do wonders for the composition for me. That big, dark gap is very distracting to me.</td>', 'I think that trimming a portion off the right bit of the frame would do wonders for the composition for me. That big, dark gap is very distracting to me.', '2008-12-05 09:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108554, 742742, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with this, but nothing particularly exciting about it either. The red pops nicely and you captured the waterfall well.</td>', 'Nothing wrong with this, but nothing particularly exciting about it either. The red pops nicely and you captured the waterfall well.', '2008-12-05 09:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108555, 742023, 98141, '<td valign="top">I LOVE manatees! This is a great shot too, The other fish in the back, the lighting is perfect, would love to hear the story behind getting this shot!</td>', 'I LOVE manatees! This is a great shot too, The other fish in the back, the lighting is perfect, would love to hear the story behind getting this shot!', '2008-12-05 09:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108556, 740889, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this pic, I think the composition is great and I think it''s got an edgy, sexy feel without going overboard.</td>', 'I like this pic, I think the composition is great and I think it''s got an edgy, sexy feel without going overboard.', '2008-12-05 09:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108557, 742231, 98141, '<td valign="top">Darling. I''d like if her feet were all the way in the frame, but the lighting is really pleasing.</td>', 'Darling. I''d like if her feet were all the way in the frame, but the lighting is really pleasing.', '2008-12-05 09:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108558, 739597, 98141, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Cool shot. The unpredicable sharpness contrasted with the blurriness is quite appealing to me.</td>', 'Whoa! Cool shot. The unpredicable sharpness contrasted with the blurriness is quite appealing to me.', '2008-12-05 09:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108559, 743775, 98141, '<td valign="top">Harsh light from the flash takes away from the photo, but nice capture of a spider''s meal.</td>', 'Harsh light from the flash takes away from the photo, but nice capture of a spider''s meal.', '2008-12-05 09:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108561, 743079, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but I do wish it were a bit sharper.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but I do wish it were a bit sharper.', '2008-12-05 09:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108563, 743063, 98141, '<td valign="top">The water looks so thick, how do people do that? Nice composition, the leaf would pop even more if the reflection wasn''t so busy with branches.</td>', 'The water looks so thick, how do people do that? Nice composition, the leaf would pop even more if the reflection wasn''t so busy with branches.', '2008-12-05 09:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108564, 742569, 98141, '<td valign="top">Awesome silhouette and awesome square frame.</td>', 'Awesome silhouette and awesome square frame.', '2008-12-05 09:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108565, 741576, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think it''s generally unflattering to look right up people''s nostrils.</td>', 'I think it''s generally unflattering to look right up people''s nostrils.', '2008-12-05 09:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108566, 743236, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good action capture, colors are a little dull for me.</td>', 'Nice composition, good action capture, colors are a little dull for me.', '2008-12-05 09:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108567, 743413, 98141, '<td valign="top">Whoa! That''s awesome. I like the snow in this pic, looks like you might have been pretty cold.</td>', 'Whoa! That''s awesome. I like the snow in this pic, looks like you might have been pretty cold.', '2008-12-05 09:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108568, 742412, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, I love the purple behind its head. Great sharpness on the eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, I love the purple behind its head. Great sharpness on the eyes.', '2008-12-05 09:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108569, 740409, 98141, '<td valign="top">The contrast feels a little muddy to me, but I like the composition, especially the bird and its reflection in the lower right.</td>', 'The contrast feels a little muddy to me, but I like the composition, especially the bird and its reflection in the lower right.', '2008-12-05 09:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108570, 743678, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this, very broadway-esque, and I think you really pulled off the lighting, but there are two faces that can''t be seen very well, one because of her shoulder and the other from the light/smoke. If those were more clear, I''d really like this more.</td>', 'I like the idea of this, very broadway-esque, and I think you really pulled off the lighting, but there are two faces that can''t be seen very well, one because of her shoulder and the other from the light/smoke. If those were more clear, I''d really like this more.', '2008-12-05 09:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108571, 741589, 98141, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the colors of this, and I like the floating windows in the upper right.</td>', 'I enjoy the colors of this, and I like the floating windows in the upper right.', '2008-12-05 09:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108572, 738371, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the jewelry in this and think you did an excellent editing job.</td>', 'I love the jewelry in this and think you did an excellent editing job.', '2008-12-05 09:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108573, 742675, 98141, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha, I love that they''re all looking right at you. I wish that pole weren''t there, but for me, your title makes this an amuzing hit :)</td>', 'Hahahaha, I love that they''re all looking right at you. I wish that pole weren''t there, but for me, your title makes this an amuzing hit :)', '2008-12-05 09:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108574, 743504, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple, warm, really captures the idea of the end of summer and the warmth of friendship.</td>', 'Nice, simple, warm, really captures the idea of the end of summer and the warmth of friendship.', '2008-12-05 09:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108575, 743443, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I''m not even sure what I''m looking at besides the moon there? I like the contrast between the blue and the... sand?</td>', 'Interesting, I''m not even sure what I''m looking at besides the moon there? I like the contrast between the blue and the... sand?', '2008-12-05 09:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108576, 743698, 98141, '<td valign="top">It looks like a two-headed bison. I like the darkness of this pic, and the contrast is fabulous.</td>', 'It looks like a two-headed bison. I like the darkness of this pic, and the contrast is fabulous.', '2008-12-05 09:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108577, 742847, 98141, '<td valign="top">Eyes should be sharper, especially if that''s the title. Editing other than that looks good.</td>', 'Eyes should be sharper, especially if that''s the title. Editing other than that looks good.', '2008-12-05 09:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108578, 741529, 98141, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice depth to this pic, and it certainly feels like it has a story to tell. I like the other boats lined up on the water.</td>', 'There''s a nice depth to this pic, and it certainly feels like it has a story to tell. I like the other boats lined up on the water.', '2008-12-05 09:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108579, 743450, 98141, '<td valign="top">Hm, doesn''t feel sharp enough to me. I do think you did a good job of using the trees to frame your shot. I also think a shallower dof would look nice.</td>', 'Hm, doesn''t feel sharp enough to me. I do think you did a good job of using the trees to frame your shot. I also think a shallower dof would look nice.', '2008-12-05 09:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108580, 741515, 98141, '<td valign="top">That baby does NOT look happy :P The light reflecting off his arms feels harsh, is it from the flash or the bright lights of the room? I feel that a closer crop on the left side would improve the composition for me.</td>', 'That baby does NOT look happy :P The light reflecting off his arms feels harsh, is it from the flash or the bright lights of the room? I feel that a closer crop on the left side would improve the composition for me.', '2008-12-05 09:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108581, 742347, 98141, '<td valign="top">All I can focus on is the belly button.</td>', 'All I can focus on is the belly button.', '2008-12-05 09:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108582, 743767, 98141, '<td valign="top">It seems to me like the focus didn''t land sharply enough where you were trying to get it, but I like the composition.</td>', 'It seems to me like the focus didn''t land sharply enough where you were trying to get it, but I like the composition.', '2008-12-05 09:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108583, 743409, 98141, '<td valign="top">Something about this really appeals to me - all the textures feel so smooth. I like the tilt.</td>', 'Something about this really appeals to me - all the textures feel so smooth. I like the tilt.', '2008-12-05 09:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108584, 741959, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I don''t feel that this pic could possibly be the one that either 1. expresses you the best or 2. expresses your talent the best for the entire month.<br/> <br/>ETA: Okay, here''s me trying to figure out what it is that I think could be improved about your submission. I think this might get long because I type while I think, so bear with me. I''m going to use examples of buildings that I think are particularly well done and contrast them with yours to figure out what''s lacking to me, if that''s alright. Here we go:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=742185" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/5112/120/742185.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/5112/120/742185.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/5112/120/742185.jpg"/></a>Here''s one that really resonates with me. I feel that because of the more open composition and the reflection, it''s more visually satisfying. There''s more depth to it, and nothing feels like it''s getting blocked. I feel that yours, in contrast, might lose some of its feeling of depth because the building in front is blocking the building in back.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=736260" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/943/120/736260.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/943/120/736260.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/943/120/736260.jpg"/></a>Here''s one that also appeals to me. Maybe I''m just a sucker for reflections? :) Here, we can see two buildings, much like in your picture, but because of the broken mirror I find it more visually engaging. Your entry feels like walking down the street and taking a picture from eye level. It doesn''t have any tricks up its sleeve, no new angles or perspectives or pizazz to separate it from what a person would normally see. I gather that you were trying to emphasize the juxtaposition of old and new, but I think your title is what seals that for me rather than the composition of the picture.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=735563" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/735563.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/735563.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/735563.jpg"/></a>Something like this (more reflections, gee I am a softy for them I guess!) with the old building reflected in the shiny new windows of the skyscraper I think would have conveyed a relationship between the buildings better. A wide gap of sky to demonstrate that they''re separated by time, but the reflection shows that they''re connected by proximity. Oops, I just let out my film degree critic who finds meaning in everything, I try not to do that too often :)<br/> <br/>All of this is not to say that I find it a completely unappealing picture, I just think that you, and especially now that I know who''s entry this is, have a way to make it different than what Joe Shmoe would see while walking down the street. Some sort of visual gimmick that visually expresses the relationship between these two awesome buildings.<br/> <br/>Oh, and include a reflection, apparently ;)</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I don''t feel that this pic could possibly be the one that either 1. expresses you the best or 2. expresses your talent the best for the entire month. ETA: Okay, here''s me trying to figure out what it is that I think could be improved about your submission. I think this might get long because I type while I think, so bear with me. I''m going to use examples of buildings that I think are particularly well done and contrast them with yours to figure out what''s lacking to me, if that''s alright. Here we go: Here''s one that really resonates with me. I feel that because of the more open composition and the reflection, it''s more visually satisfying. There''s more depth to it, and nothing feels like it''s getting blocked. I feel that yours, in contrast, might lose some of its feeling of depth because the building in front is blocking the building in back. Here''s one that also appeals to me. Maybe I''m just a sucker for reflections? :) Here, we can see two buildings, much like in your picture, but because of the broken mirror I find it more visually engaging. Your entry feels like walking down the street and taking a picture from eye level. It doesn''t have any tricks up its sleeve, no new angles or perspectives or pizazz to separate it from what a person would normally see. I gather that you were trying to emphasize the juxtaposition of old and new, but I think your title is what seals that for me rather than the composition of the picture. Something like this (more reflections, gee I am a softy for them I guess!) with the old building reflected in the shiny new windows of the skyscraper I think would have conveyed a relationship between the buildings better. A wide gap of sky to demonstrate that they''re separated by time, but the reflection shows that they''re connected by proximity. Oops, I just let out my film degree critic who finds meaning in everything, I try not to do that too often :) All of this is not to say that I find it a completely unappealing picture, I just think that you, and especially now that I know who''s entry this is, have a way to make it different than what Joe Shmoe would see while walking down the street. Some sort of visual gimmick that visually expresses the relationship between these two awesome buildings. Oh, and include a reflection, apparently ;)', '2008-12-05 09:45:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5108585, 743114, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the winding road, I wish that one cloud would have left for you since it''s a bit distracting, and I wish it were a tad bit sharper.</td>', 'I like the winding road, I wish that one cloud would have left for you since it''s a bit distracting, and I wish it were a tad bit sharper.', '2008-12-05 09:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108586, 741901, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very nice, makes me a little dizzy and a little scared, I hope you weren''t driving when you took this! :P</td>', 'Very nice, makes me a little dizzy and a little scared, I hope you weren''t driving when you took this! :P', '2008-12-05 09:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108587, 743687, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish she were a tiny bit sharper, but I think the composition is fab. The leaves make for a somewhat busy background.</td>', 'I wish she were a tiny bit sharper, but I think the composition is fab. The leaves make for a somewhat busy background.', '2008-12-05 09:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108588, 743607, 98141, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this is fun. Feels a little fuzzy, but the scope of it makes up for that in my mind.</td>', 'Whoa, this is fun. Feels a little fuzzy, but the scope of it makes up for that in my mind.', '2008-12-05 09:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108589, 743494, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great capture of textures in b&amp;w. Very nice.</td>', 'Great capture of textures in b&w. Very nice.', '2008-12-05 09:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108590, 743515, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fun hair, great lighting, I like the b&amp;w for this.</td>', 'Fun hair, great lighting, I like the b&w for this.', '2008-12-05 09:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108591, 743427, 98141, '<td valign="top">It''s very straightforward and simple. I''d like if you tried something to make it pop and stand out a little from the crowd. Try a slight overexposure or a more dramatic use of dof.</td>', 'It''s very straightforward and simple. I''d like if you tried something to make it pop and stand out a little from the crowd. Try a slight overexposure or a more dramatic use of dof.', '2008-12-05 09:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108592, 743353, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like your title and I think this pic is very cool, so many lines to work with, my eyes are engaged and happy.</td>', 'I like your title and I think this pic is very cool, so many lines to work with, my eyes are engaged and happy.', '2008-12-05 09:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108593, 738759, 98141, '<td valign="top">What a strange little building, I''m curious to see where this was taken. Great sunset colors and great depth.</td>', 'What a strange little building, I''m curious to see where this was taken. Great sunset colors and great depth.', '2008-12-05 09:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108594, 741017, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think her hair looks fabulous, but I don''t care much for the lighting or the background color.</td>', 'I think her hair looks fabulous, but I don''t care much for the lighting or the background color.', '2008-12-05 09:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108595, 743360, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think a closer crop from the bottom to remove a little more of the roof would improve the comoposition, but I love the silhouettes of the birds.</td>', 'I think a closer crop from the bottom to remove a little more of the roof would improve the comoposition, but I love the silhouettes of the birds.', '2008-12-05 09:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108596, 742619, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very excellent capture of dreary. I find dreary a really hard adjective to capture in a visually appealing/interesting manner, and you really hit the nail on the head with this. The colors are perfect.</td>', 'Very excellent capture of dreary. I find dreary a really hard adjective to capture in a visually appealing/interesting manner, and you really hit the nail on the head with this. The colors are perfect.', '2008-12-05 09:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108598, 738603, 98141, '<td valign="top">Whoa! I jumped a little there. This is a very cool picture! And a little funny because he reminds me of a muppet while his mouth is open.</td>', 'Whoa! I jumped a little there. This is a very cool picture! And a little funny because he reminds me of a muppet while his mouth is open.', '2008-12-05 09:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108600, 742205, 98141, '<td valign="top">It feels a little too smooth to me, like a lot of the texture was lost in editing or something.</td>', 'It feels a little too smooth to me, like a lot of the texture was lost in editing or something.', '2008-12-05 09:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108601, 741276, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, wish it were a smidge sharper.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, wish it were a smidge sharper.', '2008-12-05 09:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108602, 740126, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like that you captured a second when the cheetah actually looks awkward - they''re usually such graceful animals!</td>', 'I like that you captured a second when the cheetah actually looks awkward - they''re usually such graceful animals!', '2008-12-05 09:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108603, 743379, 98141, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot, but not sharp enough for me, or perhaps the lighting feels to harsh - I''m not sure, but something''s off for me.</td>', 'Adorable shot, but not sharp enough for me, or perhaps the lighting feels to harsh - I''m not sure, but something''s off for me.', '2008-12-05 09:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108604, 743424, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, such great scope!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, such great scope!', '2008-12-05 09:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108605, 740827, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish the mountains behind the bridge either went higher above it or weren''t there - right now they''re so close that I find it a bit distracting. Other than that, nice composition.</td>', 'I wish the mountains behind the bridge either went higher above it or weren''t there - right now they''re so close that I find it a bit distracting. Other than that, nice composition.', '2008-12-05 09:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108606, 738198, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not 100% sure what I"m looking at here, but I do find it interesting.</td>', 'I''m not 100% sure what I"m looking at here, but I do find it interesting.', '2008-12-05 09:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5108607, 743217, 98141, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha, that poor thing! Great dof, great capture.</td>', 'Hahahaha, that poor thing! Great dof, great capture.', '2008-12-05 09:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
