(5109597, 743454, 97166, '<td valign="top">Poor Sariel.  While training to become the next Angel of Guardians, she had a few well known mishaps that almost caused her descension from the guild. <br/> <br/>The most famous of these was the unfortunate Railway Disaster of ''08.  Why she thought that an umbrella was an apt defense against an on-rushing diesel locomotive, heaven knew.<br/> <br/>Her failure there, however, was to become a motivating force.  In the centuries to follow, she became the greatest Angel of Guardians that heaven ever knew, and she never lost another soul again.</td>', 'Poor Sariel.  While training to become the next Angel of Guardians, she had a few well known mishaps that almost caused her descension from the guild.  The most famous of these was the unfortunate Railway Disaster of ''08.  Why she thought that an umbrella was an apt defense against an on-rushing diesel locomotive, heaven knew. Her failure there, however, was to become a motivating force.  In the centuries to follow, she became the greatest Angel of Guardians that heaven ever knew, and she never lost another soul again.', '2008-12-05 13:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
