(5110192, 743687, 97166, '<td valign="top">She''d been enjoying her day. Running around with Fluffy through the leaves, playing in a bit of a puddle by the path, playing on the swings and slide as they''d stopped by the playground.  Yes, all around and enjoyable day.<br/> <br/>Suddenly, a scream was heard in the distance, and an explosion above the treetops.  She looked up, concern suddenly taking control of the smile she''d worn just moments before.  Someone was in trouble!<br/> <br/>As she suddenly burst off running, she tore off layers of outer clothing to reveal the secret that she kept, the lavender coloring of the rayon tights that were now revealed.  She leapt into the air and flew off towards the smoke and flame and sounds of emergency. <br/> <br/>It was time once again for Little Lady Periwinkle to save the day once more.</td>', 'She''d been enjoying her day. Running around with Fluffy through the leaves, playing in a bit of a puddle by the path, playing on the swings and slide as they''d stopped by the playground.  Yes, all around and enjoyable day. Suddenly, a scream was heard in the distance, and an explosion above the treetops.  She looked up, concern suddenly taking control of the smile she''d worn just moments before.  Someone was in trouble! As she suddenly burst off running, she tore off layers of outer clothing to reveal the secret that she kept, the lavender coloring of the rayon tights that were now revealed.  She leapt into the air and flew off towards the smoke and flame and sounds of emergency.  It was time once again for Little Lady Periwinkle to save the day once more.', '2008-12-05 16:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
