(5110871, 743504, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like this but their heads appear to be glowing. Slightly oversharpened maybe? Also, it''s hard to make out their positions. Would like to have seen them a little closer in the frame. The lighting is beautiful.</td>', 'I like this but their heads appear to be glowing. Slightly oversharpened maybe? Also, it''s hard to make out their positions. Would like to have seen them a little closer in the frame. The lighting is beautiful.', '2008-12-05 22:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
