(5110905, 743362, 83313, '<td valign="top">The title is a great attitude to have, as you may be getting killed by low votes on this one. It''s a nice close shot of the bird, with lots of detail showing and a great bokeh background. Hard lighting is probably what''s hurting it the most. In spite of that, you maintained some good detail in both the shadows and highlights..</td>', 'The title is a great attitude to have, as you may be getting killed by low votes on this one. It''s a nice close shot of the bird, with lots of detail showing and a great bokeh background. Hard lighting is probably what''s hurting it the most. In spite of that, you maintained some good detail in both the shadows and highlights..', '2008-12-05 23:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110906, 738295, 83313, '<td valign="top">You forgot to include some water drops.</td>', 'You forgot to include some water drops.', '2008-12-05 23:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110909, 738265, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is really well done. Skyline shots are hard, because they all tend to look alike. Waiting for the lighting and weather to come together like this was half the battle, and the expert black and white processing drives it home. One of my top picks.</td>', 'This is really well done. Skyline shots are hard, because they all tend to look alike. Waiting for the lighting and weather to come together like this was half the battle, and the expert black and white processing drives it home. One of my top picks.', '2008-12-05 23:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
