(5110927, 743294, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems oversharpened, or something. Might be JPEG compression. This is a pretty detailed image, and your file size of only 128k, plus the appearance, indicates you probably lost some detail to compression. You had up to 200k to utilize. That''s all that is keeping me from giving this a nice high vote.</td>', 'Seems oversharpened, or something. Might be JPEG compression. This is a pretty detailed image, and your file size of only 128k, plus the appearance, indicates you probably lost some detail to compression. You had up to 200k to utilize. That''s all that is keeping me from giving this a nice high vote.', '2008-12-05 23:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5110928, 741288, 76335, '<td valign="top">Too soft and maybe oversaturated. I like that you framed this such that the "things" on its wings (do they have a name?) look like eyes staring at him. Wonder if that''s some evolutionary vestige...</td>', 'Too soft and maybe oversaturated. I like that you framed this such that the "things" on its wings (do they have a name?) look like eyes staring at him. Wonder if that''s some evolutionary vestige...', '2008-12-05 23:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
