(5112668, 743190, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve been here, but during the day. Fabulous take on this place, wonderful perspective, lighting is supurb, but watch the sharpening in the foreground ...  A bit much IMO.</td>', 'I''ve been here, but during the day. Fabulous take on this place, wonderful perspective, lighting is supurb, but watch the sharpening in the foreground ...  A bit much IMO.', '2008-12-06 18:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
