(5112722, 738999, 58452, '<td valign="top">The best macro I''ve seen in a while. Love the golden colors and the way you arranged the DOF as if with a paint brush. In all the right places.  While some might think this is over processed I like the whole thing. My vote for blue. 10 Congrats.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-08 00:07:34.</i></td>', 'The best macro I''ve seen in a while. Love the golden colors and the way you arranged the DOF as if with a paint brush. In all the right places.  While some might think this is over processed I like the whole thing. My vote for blue. 10 Congrats.', '2008-12-06 19:21:22.000000', '2008-12-08 00:07:34.000000', 1),
