(5113042, 742884, 81362, '<td valign="top">Holiday decoratons nicely subdued in the background, but the overall image tone feels somber. Increasing brightness might help make this more festive.</td>', 'Holiday decoratons nicely subdued in the background, but the overall image tone feels somber. Increasing brightness might help make this more festive.', '2008-12-06 22:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113088, 743170, 77724, '<td valign="top">You do realize there are people on this site who were not even born when that movie came out?.  BTW - cool shot.</td>', 'You do realize there are people on this site who were not even born when that movie came out?.  BTW - cool shot.', '2008-12-06 22:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113091, 741515, 81362, '<td valign="top">This will bring back memories years from now. It is a good snap shot, but has potential to become an artistic piece too. I think many elements of the background distract from our scrunched-face subject. On the right hand side of the image, consider cropping just outside of the baby''s left elbow and before the white verticle background element (eliminating most of the dark part of the background past the gloved hand), even though it breaks a rule and cuts off the gloved index finger. On the other side, converting the green fabric to something much darker or even black might be tried in Photoshop.</td>', 'This will bring back memories years from now. It is a good snap shot, but has potential to become an artistic piece too. I think many elements of the background distract from our scrunched-face subject. On the right hand side of the image, consider cropping just outside of the baby''s left elbow and before the white verticle background element (eliminating most of the dark part of the background past the gloved hand), even though it breaks a rule and cuts off the gloved index finger. On the other side, converting the green fabric to something much darker or even black might be tried in Photoshop.', '2008-12-06 22:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113093, 743764, 77724, '<td valign="top">If they awarded ribbons for titles this would win for sure.</td>', 'If they awarded ribbons for titles this would win for sure.', '2008-12-06 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113099, 743338, 81362, '<td valign="top">The smooth water makes for very nice reflections. I would enjoy them more without the foreground stems and leaves.</td>', 'The smooth water makes for very nice reflections. I would enjoy them more without the foreground stems and leaves.', '2008-12-06 22:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113119, 739142, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like it would be impressive in color. Would be interested in learing what led to the decision to use B&amp;W. The bright white area on our right keeps drawing my eye out of the picture. Might consider a crop to eliminate that part.</td>', 'Looks like it would be impressive in color. Would be interested in learing what led to the decision to use B&W. The bright white area on our right keeps drawing my eye out of the picture. Might consider a crop to eliminate that part.', '2008-12-06 23:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5113170, 743571, 75585, '<td valign="top">Wish this had a bit more of white at the top in lieu of the bottom - bit a very sweet shot and well executed</td>', 'Wish this had a bit more of white at the top in lieu of the bottom - bit a very sweet shot and well executed', '2008-12-06 23:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
