(5114733, 743387, 54478, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors. I love how the colors flow with the movements of the flouds. Onet thing that feels a bit off is the water. One portion of the water looks kind of hazy as if it was done with a long exposure. Then the region with the rocks, the reflection looks smooth with calm waves. Maybe its just me.</td>', 'Awesome colors. I love how the colors flow with the movements of the flouds. Onet thing that feels a bit off is the water. One portion of the water looks kind of hazy as if it was done with a long exposure. Then the region with the rocks, the reflection looks smooth with calm waves. Maybe its just me.', '2008-12-07 19:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
