(5115929, 743413, 41337, '<td valign="top">I tried to leave a comment about 10 minutes before turnover but the site wouldn''t let me. In a nutshell, I thought this was a fantastic shot. The contrast between the nothingness that remains of the deer''s upper body and the completely intact legs makes this quite powerful. Congrats on your 12th place finish. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657188" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657188.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657188.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/41337/120/657188.gif"/></a></td>', 'I tried to leave a comment about 10 minutes before turnover but the site wouldn''t let me. In a nutshell, I thought this was a fantastic shot. The contrast between the nothingness that remains of the deer''s upper body and the completely intact legs makes this quite powerful. Congrats on your 12th place finish.  ', '2008-12-08 02:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
