(5116185, 742959, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going to own up and let you know that I gave one of the conspicuously low marks. Now I have read your description, I really should justify it and apologise.<br/> <br/>When I looked at this image I thought it was a still life - the ''static-ness'' and the difference in the foliage colour at what appears to be a fixed point in the middle distance made me think this was a shot of an exhibit at a natural history museum. The background looks like a painting and the foreground looks separated and still. And overall the lighting doesn''t look like daylight.<br/> <br/>Now I''ve read your description, I find I have to reconsider my score.<br/> <br/>Apologies again, but I thought you deserved an explanation.</td>', 'I''m going to own up and let you know that I gave one of the conspicuously low marks. Now I have read your description, I really should justify it and apologise. When I looked at this image I thought it was a still life - the ''static-ness'' and the difference in the foliage colour at what appears to be a fixed point in the middle distance made me think this was a shot of an exhibit at a natural history museum. The background looks like a painting and the foreground looks separated and still. And overall the lighting doesn''t look like daylight. Now I''ve read your description, I find I have to reconsider my score. Apologies again, but I thought you deserved an explanation.', '2008-12-08 05:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
