(5116220, 743225, 22301, '<td valign="top">I thought this was stunning and gave you a a ten. The light on his face emphsizes his wondrous expression, a hidden language between siblings perhaps. One to be proud of.</td>', 'I thought this was stunning and gave you a a ten. The light on his face emphsizes his wondrous expression, a hidden language between siblings perhaps. One to be proud of.', '2008-12-08 05:32:19.000000', NULL, 0),
