(5116346, 742023, 79141, '<td valign="top">wonderful  image <br/>congrats on a top 10.<br/>i honestly thought you  took this  in water  its that good<br/>we have a similar species here called a dugong</td>', 'wonderful  image congrats on a top 10.i honestly thought you  took this  in water  its that goodwe have a similar species here called a dugong', '2008-12-08 06:56:10.000000', NULL, 0),
