(5116938, 743006, 70265, '<td valign="top">I think this should have scored a bit higher as well. There''s a lot to like: the background works perfectly with her outfit, love the pastels, skin tones are good, pose and eye contact good as well. My only suggestions for slight improvement would be a teeny more saturation &amp; sharpness, and maybe a tighter crop to get that angelic little face closer to the viewer. Good luck with your future entries!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think this should have scored a bit higher as well. There''s a lot to like: the background works perfectly with her outfit, love the pastels, skin tones are good, pose and eye contact good as well. My only suggestions for slight improvement would be a teeny more saturation & sharpness, and maybe a tighter crop to get that angelic little face closer to the viewer. Good luck with your future entries! ', '2008-12-08 11:28:18.000000', NULL, 0),
