(5117933, 743576, 23484, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the beauty of Montana. I was there once in a little town called Grass Range.  Actually Katherine, I think the composition here is very nice. I think the soft focus is holding it back. I know that gets difficult sometimes when the subject is approaching quicker than expected.</td>', 'Ahh, the beauty of Montana. I was there once in a little town called Grass Range.  Actually Katherine, I think the composition here is very nice. I think the soft focus is holding it back. I know that gets difficult sometimes when the subject is approaching quicker than expected.', '2008-12-08 19:09:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5117956, 738999, 14476, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ROZ</a>!!!<br/>Congratulations on a fine entry and a fine finish.  Of course if it is the definitive bug, it''s from Roz.  I just didn''t really "look" at the front page until now and then your name and great image just popped out.<br/> <br/>Fantastic, lady, fantastic.<br/> <br/>:-))</td>', ' ROZ!!!Congratulations on a fine entry and a fine finish.  Of course if it is the definitive bug, it''s from Roz.  I just didn''t really "look" at the front page until now and then your name and great image just popped out. Fantastic, lady, fantastic. :-))', '2008-12-08 19:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
