(5118060, 743114, 47541, '<td valign="top">Some random thoughts...The contrast of the red rocks and blue sky is good but the blue is a little flat for DPC.  If we could follow the road around fully then that would guide our eye through the frame but as it is broken we get to the first bend and feel a little lost.  Given this I wonder how a POV where you were laying on the side of the road would have gone - it might have emphasised the "road" element of your title and also added more scale to the rocks. Another "issue" you have is that your weather is just too good - some more clouds in the sky would have been nice - but that''s the price you pay for being in WA ;)</td>', 'Some random thoughts...The contrast of the red rocks and blue sky is good but the blue is a little flat for DPC.  If we could follow the road around fully then that would guide our eye through the frame but as it is broken we get to the first bend and feel a little lost.  Given this I wonder how a POV where you were laying on the side of the road would have gone - it might have emphasised the "road" element of your title and also added more scale to the rocks. Another "issue" you have is that your weather is just too good - some more clouds in the sky would have been nice - but that''s the price you pay for being in WA ;)', '2008-12-08 20:16:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5118062, 743190, 56744, '<td valign="top">Everything is perfect and pleasent. Awesome image!</td>', 'Everything is perfect and pleasent. Awesome image!', '2008-12-08 20:17:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5118064, 743505, 47541, '<td valign="top">Next time try using a blur on the background rather than removing it</td>', 'Next time try using a blur on the background rather than removing it', '2008-12-08 20:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
