(5121863, 737495, 83845, '<td valign="top">OOps, we both got the shaft.  I had some bird seed in my shot and I knew I couldn''t edit it out, so I cropped in close then enlarged the canvas and filled it in black.  I didn''t even consider that might be illegal in Advanced.  Oh well, next time.</td>', 'OOps, we both got the shaft.  I had some bird seed in my shot and I knew I couldn''t edit it out, so I cropped in close then enlarged the canvas and filled it in black.  I didn''t even consider that might be illegal in Advanced.  Oh well, next time.', '2008-12-10 08:03:28.000000', NULL, 0),
