(5151226, 737893, 90414, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot... very similar of course to the below referenced shot on the cover of Pop Photo by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=16046" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Caba</a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=274611" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/430/120/274611.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/430/120/274611.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/430/120/274611.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Very nice shot... very similar of course to the below referenced shot on the cover of Pop Photo by  Caba ', '2008-12-25 21:17:05.000000', NULL, 0),
