(5151792, 740745, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Was checking out your Christmas tree and recognized this one.  Just read the remarks.  Glad to see someone else who takes out their frustrations in the newly allowed "photographer''s comments during the challenge" feature.  And yes, I quite like this one.  Bah on the 2 second viewers with no sense of appreciation for enjoying a photograph.</td>', 'Heh!  Was checking out your Christmas tree and recognized this one.  Just read the remarks.  Glad to see someone else who takes out their frustrations in the newly allowed "photographer''s comments during the challenge" feature.  And yes, I quite like this one.  Bah on the 2 second viewers with no sense of appreciation for enjoying a photograph.', '2008-12-26 09:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5152056, 743576, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think the score you got was a little too low.  I did give it a 6.  If the face was a little more in focus I probably would have given this a higher score. I loved the look, the background, and the buck teeth lol.</td>', 'I think the score you got was a little too low.  I did give it a 6.  If the face was a little more in focus I probably would have given this a higher score. I loved the look, the background, and the buck teeth lol.', '2008-12-26 14:20:03.000000', NULL, 0),
