(5152885, 743576, 25190, '<td valign="top">I feel you captured the right shot some one sure had his attention and the DOF is exellcent i love those big horns ..good shot jdubs:)</td>', 'I feel you captured the right shot some one sure had his attention and the DOF is exellcent i love those big horns ..good shot jdubs:)', '2008-12-27 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5154337, 742844, 88136, '<td valign="top">trippy photo! i like the angle you chose on the main building. i also like the choice in a background building, its all wavey and cool. lovely blue sky as well</td>', 'trippy photo! i like the angle you chose on the main building. i also like the choice in a background building, its all wavey and cool. lovely blue sky as well', '2008-12-28 00:00:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5156354, 742865, 88136, '<td valign="top">this got a 7 from me, looks more like an 8 today though. i like how the trees fade to nothing, makes the veiwer have to think about it longer. beatuiful red leaves/flowers on the ground, the were captured nicely. adds that perfect bit of ''oomf''</td>', 'this got a 7 from me, looks more like an 8 today though. i like how the trees fade to nothing, makes the veiwer have to think about it longer. beatuiful red leaves/flowers on the ground, the were captured nicely. adds that perfect bit of ''oomf''', '2008-12-29 12:20:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5156664, 743049, 100385, '<td valign="top">A great reportage shot. Makes you smile, well done.</td>', 'A great reportage shot. Makes you smile, well done.', '2008-12-29 15:56:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5156817, 743049, 68586, '<td valign="top">Superb capture ! Well spotted.</td>', 'Superb capture ! Well spotted.', '2008-12-29 18:01:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5160031, 743576, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wonderful nature shot. Good detail and isolation of the background. Probably would have done a bit better with more contrast as the people here really love pop.</td>', 'Wonderful nature shot. Good detail and isolation of the background. Probably would have done a bit better with more contrast as the people here really love pop.', '2008-12-31 13:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5160066, 743418, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very engaging shot. Really enjoy the composition and the wonderful light. Truly memorable photo for both the family and everyone in general. <br/> <br/>Best wishes into the New Year.</td>', 'Very engaging shot. Really enjoy the composition and the wonderful light. Truly memorable photo for both the family and everyone in general.  Best wishes into the New Year.', '2008-12-31 13:25:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5166855, 743343, 98663, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smudgeSMJ:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful, but I think a tad shorter of exposure would make it even sharper. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Kellyo, what do you mean you don''t know how to rate this picture? Look at it, its very crisp and a gorgeous looking picture.  I don''t think it matters if you know what a good astro photo is or not.  If you like how it looks and its crisp and not annoying to look at then give it a good score.  :) keep up the good work jlanoue I am jealous. I wish I could take awesome pictures like this one.</td>', 'Originally posted by smudgeSMJ: Beautiful, but I think a tad shorter of exposure would make it even sharper.   Kellyo, what do you mean you don''t know how to rate this picture? Look at it, its very crisp and a gorgeous looking picture.  I don''t think it matters if you know what a good astro photo is or not.  If you like how it looks and its crisp and not annoying to look at then give it a good score.  :) keep up the good work jlanoue I am jealous. I wish I could take awesome pictures like this one.', '2009-01-03 04:59:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5167506, 743203, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed. The warm sepia is a nice balance to the cold imagery.</td>', 'Beautifully composed. The warm sepia is a nice balance to the cold imagery.', '2009-01-03 12:17:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5171015, 742023, 43774, '<td valign="top">No way!!! I can''t believe the museum demanded that it be taken down. It was a fantastic photo.</td>', 'No way!!! I can''t believe the museum demanded that it be taken down. It was a fantastic photo.', '2009-01-04 20:25:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5171050, 742023, 67152, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand how it need to be removed here but could be shown on another web site.  Something seems rather odd here...<br/> <br/>It''s a great photo and it is too bad it had to be taken down.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand how it need to be removed here but could be shown on another web site.  Something seems rather odd here... It''s a great photo and it is too bad it had to be taken down.', '2009-01-04 20:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5175317, 738099, 92643, '<td valign="top">I actually love the mystery created by not being able to see much of the subject, very intriguing.  Also, I love the flame of orange on the subject''s hair, as well as the touches of blue and green in the background, as those patches of color add vitality to an otherwise monochromatic pictures.</td>', 'I actually love the mystery created by not being able to see much of the subject, very intriguing.  Also, I love the flame of orange on the subject''s hair, as well as the touches of blue and green in the background, as those patches of color add vitality to an otherwise monochromatic pictures.', '2009-01-06 18:02:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5177909, 738719, 57936, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the helpful comments folks! Exactly why I post pictures to sites like this! :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the helpful comments folks! Exactly why I post pictures to sites like this! :) ', '2009-01-07 12:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5179440, 741901, 37252, '<td valign="top">Driving down the road toward an endless sea of trees. The photog spots a vast mountain range just beyond the forest and sets his sights high as he clicks his shutter, when all of a sudden the traffic ahead brakes. Ouch! That damn eye piece hurts when it embeds itself in the eye.</td>', 'Driving down the road toward an endless sea of trees. The photog spots a vast mountain range just beyond the forest and sets his sights high as he clicks his shutter, when all of a sudden the traffic ahead brakes. Ouch! That damn eye piece hurts when it embeds itself in the eye.', '2009-01-07 23:53:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5180045, 742023, 56109, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Weird about the removal.</td>', 'Great shot. Weird about the removal.', '2009-01-08 08:24:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5180819, 742583, 53964, '<td valign="top">Gee, I totally missed the trout. I was too busy oohing and ahhing :)</td>', 'Gee, I totally missed the trout. I was too busy oohing and ahhing :)', '2009-01-08 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5181842, 743602, 77192, '<td valign="top">The colours in this are amazing!</td>', 'The colours in this are amazing!', '2009-01-09 07:31:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5183516, 743180, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the border - gives him something to lean against.  He could have a bit at his feet too if you were so inclined.  How did you light this?  Feels integrated but I suspect you used lights?  And how did you get ahold of Leonardo DiCaprio?  Tones are excellent as always.  I like the subtle touch of the fade to desat sorta thing.</td>', 'I like the border - gives him something to lean against.  He could have a bit at his feet too if you were so inclined.  How did you light this?  Feels integrated but I suspect you used lights?  And how did you get ahold of Leonardo DiCaprio?  Tones are excellent as always.  I like the subtle touch of the fade to desat sorta thing.', '2009-01-10 14:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5186024, 742886, 58135, '<td valign="top">wish i was there!!</td>', 'wish i was there!!', '2009-01-12 00:39:36.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5189081, 740100, 91360, '<td valign="top">great shot! love the reflection.</td>', 'great shot! love the reflection.', '2009-01-13 12:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5189667, 743424, 101798, '<td valign="top">Great shot...like the contrast between the mountain with snow and barren ground...add texture.</td>', 'Great shot...like the contrast between the mountain with snow and barren ground...add texture.', '2009-01-13 19:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5209620, 741279, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like how you included the rocks in this.  It''s kind of weird because I look down at the rocks, and they seem so small.  So I expect the rest of your scene to be much farther away.  So this makes me question the depth of perception in my head or the perceived size of the rocks.  Beautiful tones in this.</td>', 'I like how you included the rocks in this.  It''s kind of weird because I look down at the rocks, and they seem so small.  So I expect the rest of your scene to be much farther away.  So this makes me question the depth of perception in my head or the perceived size of the rocks.  Beautiful tones in this.', '2009-01-21 13:37:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5210161, 740100, 46314, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. I love the clarity of the water and the fine detail of the foliage, branches and windmill sails.</td>', 'Awesome shot. I love the clarity of the water and the fine detail of the foliage, branches and windmill sails.', '2009-01-21 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5211278, 742023, 97166, '<td valign="top">I call shenanigans.</td>', 'I call shenanigans.', '2009-01-22 06:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214473, 742664, 39427, '<td valign="top">really, really like the subtlety of the tones in this image, but think it could have benefited from a non-centered composition, namely, the left side of the image is not as interesting as the right... but i gave it a 7 during voting</td>', 'really, really like the subtlety of the tones in this image, but think it could have benefited from a non-centered composition, namely, the left side of the image is not as interesting as the right... but i gave it a 7 during voting', '2009-01-23 12:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214481, 741959, 81530, '<td valign="top">Very surprising finish. Got a 6 from me!</td>', 'Very surprising finish. Got a 6 from me!', '2009-01-23 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5214526, 742664, 58457, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 5.  Looking at it closer, maybe I''d revote a point higher, but I think I don''t like the cactus being so centered.  What I do like is the subtle layering of the background mountains in the haze.</td>', 'I gave you a 5.  Looking at it closer, maybe I''d revote a point higher, but I think I don''t like the cactus being so centered.  What I do like is the subtle layering of the background mountains in the haze.', '2009-01-23 12:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5216322, 743180, 100831, '<td valign="top">I too like the border (and I''m not, generally, a border person). But this is kind of like reading a book -quality border. It fits with the tilt. Congrats on the creativity and light!<br/>Penny Street</td>', 'I too like the border (and I''m not, generally, a border person). But this is kind of like reading a book -quality border. It fits with the tilt. Congrats on the creativity and light!Penny Street', '2009-01-24 12:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5217211, 742664, 76430, '<td valign="top">Following up on your forum post about your biggest challenge disappointment.  Maybe my notebook monitor isn''t displaying this properly, because nobody said this previously, but to me it looks far too dark on the land and too light in the sky.  It looks to me like a grad ND filter or bracketing and tone mapping would really help it.  Also the horizon looks tilted to me, but it''s hard to tell with these landscapes that may be slopes.</td>', 'Following up on your forum post about your biggest challenge disappointment.  Maybe my notebook monitor isn''t displaying this properly, because nobody said this previously, but to me it looks far too dark on the land and too light in the sky.  It looks to me like a grad ND filter or bracketing and tone mapping would really help it.  Also the horizon looks tilted to me, but it''s hard to tell with these landscapes that may be slopes.', '2009-01-25 00:47:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5218344, 743643, 34192, '<td valign="top">how do I get my hair to look that cool?  I like the shot.  I like the processing. People here have no appreciation...</td>', 'how do I get my hair to look that cool?  I like the shot.  I like the processing. People here have no appreciation...', '2009-01-25 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5223969, 743697, 46177, '<td valign="top">I love the glow from the water that surrounds the bird. I can see why you love it, very pretty shot!</td>', 'I love the glow from the water that surrounds the bird. I can see why you love it, very pretty shot!', '2009-01-28 09:53:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5224139, 738603, 28564, '<td valign="top">An absolutely spectacular photograph.<br/>Outstanding detail, lighting, and composition here.<br/>Congratulations on your first place win!</td>', 'An absolutely spectacular photograph.Outstanding detail, lighting, and composition here.Congratulations on your first place win!', '2009-01-28 11:06:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5224533, 743697, 64568, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, love the water, but the bird is perfect, excellent exposure and bokeh</td>', 'beautiful shot, love the water, but the bird is perfect, excellent exposure and bokeh', '2009-01-28 14:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5226407, 743299, 16230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, colors, and clarity! Congrats on a great photo!</td>', 'Wonderful composition, colors, and clarity! Congrats on a great photo!', '2009-01-29 17:49:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5233827, 743465, 31637, '<td valign="top">Maybe if they had pointed ears or some Andorian antennaes.</td>', 'Maybe if they had pointed ears or some Andorian antennaes.', '2009-02-01 22:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5240407, 740100, 28564, '<td valign="top">very good sharpness and composition here... i like this shots with the reflection.</td>', 'very good sharpness and composition here... i like this shots with the reflection.', '2009-02-05 06:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5242119, 743405, 12611, '<td valign="top">Fantastically underrated, soft and lush, the grass is perfect, i guess people sisnt like the puddles but i think the whole shot it A++.</td>', 'Fantastically underrated, soft and lush, the grass is perfect, i guess people sisnt like the puddles but i think the whole shot it A++.', '2009-02-06 07:32:16.000000', NULL, 0),
