(5578435, 740100, 47906, '<td valign="top">Very crisp clean reflection in this image. I gave this a 8 in voting. I thought you have a strong composition with the lake/river leading your eye into the frame and to your subject. Your sharpness and detail were nice as well. I thought the forground interest of the landing on the otherside of the river was a nice touch as well. Very tranquil and calming shot.</td>', 'Very crisp clean reflection in this image. I gave this a 8 in voting. I thought you have a strong composition with the lake/river leading your eye into the frame and to your subject. Your sharpness and detail were nice as well. I thought the forground interest of the landing on the otherside of the river was a nice touch as well. Very tranquil and calming shot.', '2009-07-18 12:48:59.000000', NULL, 0),
