(5615128, 743523, 69008, '<td valign="top">I feel that not having the tops of the weeds may have hurt this shot in voting.  I have noticed that when I am looking thru the viewfinder that I make myself check for that.  Plants just don''t seem complete without seeing the tops of them.  I like the curley leaves and the BG color in the water in this shot, and I understand what you saw in the scene.</td>', 'I feel that not having the tops of the weeds may have hurt this shot in voting.  I have noticed that when I am looking thru the viewfinder that I make myself check for that.  Plants just don''t seem complete without seeing the tops of them.  I like the curley leaves and the BG color in the water in this shot, and I understand what you saw in the scene.', '2009-08-18 02:51:08.000000', NULL, 0),
